WHAT YOU CAN DO

You may install and run this software on hardware you own or control, for
your own personal or organizational use — at home, for your family, or for
your team. You may modify your own local copy for your own use: change
settings, tweak layouts, poke around in the code, whatever helps you get the
most out of it on your own hardware.

Continued access to new versions, themes, and features requires an active
Piazza HQ license (or a release published during a free period). A lapsed
license doesn't stop what's already installed from running — it stops new
updates from being made available to that installation.


